    "short_description": "Zenith Payments Pty Ltd is a privately owned Australian company specializing in payment processing and prepaid card solutions. Established in 2014, its roots trace back to 1984, and it operates from Balmain, New South Wales. Zenith employs around 51 to 200 people and serves clients across Australia and New Zealand.\n\nThe company offers a range of services, including payment processing, prepaid cards, expense cards, Visa Debit, EFTPOS, and gift cards. Its solutions cater to various sectors, such as business-to-business payments through B2Bpay, school payments via School EasyPay, childcare payments with ChildCare EasyPay, and travel payments through TravelPay. Zenith also provides specialized services for the real estate and thoroughbred racing industries. With a focus on high-value corporate partners, Zenith Payments is known for its commitment to delivering tailored solutions and maintaining strong client relationships.",
